BRUTE FORCE

Code:
```cpp
class Solution {
public:
    void reverseString(vector<char>& s) {
        vector<char> temp;

        for (int i = s.size() - 1; i >= 0; i--) {
            temp.push_back(s[i]);
        }

        s = temp;
    }
};
```

TC: O(n)  
SC: O(n)


OPTIMAL

Code:
```cpp
class Solution {
public:
    void reverseString(vector<char>& s) {
        int left = 0;
        int right = s.size() - 1;

        while (left < right) {
            swap(s[left], s[right]);
            left++;
            right--;
        }
    }
};
```

TC: O(n)  
SC: O(1)
